eight, eyes wide and locked on the gap, eyebrows lifted high, face drained pale but thrown bright by an orange key light from the fires so he separates cleanly from the dark. Behind him a line of military supply trucks is halted nose to tail on the intact half of the bridge, headlights smeared by haze. A column of fire and black smoke rises through the middle of the frame and cuts it vertically; the sky above is a black smoke-choked ceiling with drifting embers. The lower part of the picture continues into unlit water and oily smoke with no detail. no text, no letters, no words, no numbers, no captions, no watermark."
