      "concept_ko": "제목의 '한 달 만에 … 끊어놨나'가 감춘 규모를 흑해 쪽에서 이행하는 컷. 흑해함대 전투자산 약 30% 파괴·손상, 철도 페리 슬라뱌닌·아반가르드 격파로 러시아에 흑해 운용 가능 철도 페리가 한 척도 남지 않았다는 데이터가 근거다. 전경의 우크라이나 무인체계 운용병은 긍정형(온전·선명한 국기, 확신), 원경의 기울어져 불타는 페리는 부정형으로 갈라 배치했다. 4번과 달리 여성 인물·야간 청색 지배·정면 응시로 표정과 색을 벌렸다.",
      "prompt_en": "COMPOSITION RULE, HIGHEST PRIORITY: the scene fills the entire 16:9 frame edge to edge as a single full-bleed image — never a letterbox band, never an empty panel, never a flat colour block. The bottom three-eighths of the image height — that is the lowest 37%, roughly the bottom 270 pixels of a 720-pixel-tall frame — is the same continuous scene rendered dark, smoky and free of detail so overlay text stays readable, while all faces, flags, weapons and key objects sit entirely within the upper five-eighths. Anything held or carried sits at mid height, never near the bottom edge. Style: heavy digital oil painting worked over a photographic base, thick visible brushwork and impasto texture on flags, smoke and fabric, dramatic hard lighting, heavy atmospheric haze, one dominant colour drowning the frame, every part of the upper five-eighths packed edge to edge with elements and no empty space, cinematic wide-angle, very high contrast, painterly and rough rather than clean — a matte-painting finish, NOT a crisp photo composite, NOT a studio cut-out. Scene: night over the Black Sea, the whole picture drowned in deep cold blue with one red fire glow on the horizon. An enormous Ukrainian flag — a horizontal upper band of bright blue over a lower band of yellow, two bands only, no emblem — fills the entire right half of the frame from top to bottom, whole and undamaged, flying taut in hard wind with deep rippling folds, its colours held vivid by a hard cold spotlight. In the left foreground a Ukrainian naval unmanned-systems operator, a woman in her thirties in a dark shell jacket with a headset pushed back on her ears, is framed chest-up and occupies a third of the frame width, no hands in the frame: eyes locked forward and unblinking, brows drawn level, lips parted just enough to breathe out, one cheek washed red by the distant fire while the other stays blue in the night. Behind her a line of low unmanned surface vessels cuts wakes across the black water toward the horizon, spray lit hard from the side. Far away on the left, at the mouth of the strait, a large car ferry lists heavily and burns, orange flame crawling along its superstructure, and beyond it the long strait bridge shows only as a thin dark line under drifting smoke. Camera at deck level looking slightly across the water. Toward the bottom the scene continues into black swell and low sea haze with no detail. no text, no letters, no words, no numbers, no captions, no watermark."
